OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSPs accused of racism over
OL,4,Aburka ban debate at Holyrood
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform MSPs have been accused of racism
OL,7,Fahead of a Holyrood debate about
OL,8,Fbanning face-coverings, including
OL,9,Fburkas, from public places.
OL,11,FReform's deputy leader in Scotland,
OL,12,FThomas Kerr, has lodged a motion
OL,13,Fraising the prospect of balaclavas and
OL,14,Freligious face coverings being outlawed
OL,15,Fin public in the interests of public
OL,16,Fsafety.
OL,18,FFirst Minister Swinney said Reform MSPs
OL,19,Fwere seeking to divide communities,
OL,20,Fwhile protesters outside Holyrood
OL,21,Faccused the party of demonising Muslim
OL,22,Fwomen.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
